# Working documents kept out of the repository on purpose.
#
# premium-open-core-analysis.md is commercial strategy — how parts of og could be
# monetised — and was deliberately never committed. It contains no secrets, but it
# is not something a public community tool should ship.
#
# og-cli-dx-handoff.md is the brief the whole DX roadmap came from. It is only
# ignored because it has never been committed, NOT because it should not be:
# docs/DX_ANALYSIS.md names it as its input, so a clone currently has a dangling
# reference. Moving it to docs/ and committing it would be the tidier answer.
/docs/premium-open-core-analysis.md
/og-cli-dx-handoff.md
